---
import "../../styles/animations.css";
---

<figure class="an-wrap">
  <svg class="an rl" viewBox="0 0 480 270" role="img" aria-label="A token bucket lets requests through until it is empty, then rejects them"><rect class="nd " x="16" y="90" width="100" height="70" rx="12"/><image href="/images/ruvio-mark-128.png" x="26" y="99" width="22" height="22"/><text class="b" x="77.0" y="115" text-anchor="middle">Client</text><rect class="nd " x="190" y="40" width="120" height="150" rx="12"/><image href="/images/ruvio-mark-128.png" x="200" y="49" width="22" height="22"/><text class="b" x="261.0" y="65" text-anchor="middle">LIMIT</text><rect class="nd " x="384" y="90" width="80" height="70" rx="12"/><image href="/images/ruvio-mark-128.png" x="394" y="99" width="22" height="22"/><text class="b" x="435.0" y="115" text-anchor="middle">App</text><path class="ln" d="M116 125 L190 125"/><path class="ln" d="M310 125 L384 125"/><circle cx="222" cy="110" r="9" fill="var(--c1)" style="animation-name:rl-t0"/><circle cx="248" cy="110" r="9" fill="var(--c1)" style="animation-name:rl-t1"/><circle cx="274" cy="110" r="9" fill="var(--c1)" style="animation-name:rl-t2"/><circle cx="235" cy="142" r="9" fill="var(--c1)" style="animation-name:rl-t3"/><circle cx="261" cy="142" r="9" fill="var(--c1)" style="animation-name:rl-t4"/><text class="sm m" x="250" y="178" text-anchor="middle">tokens left</text><g class="rl-w0"><circle class="pk" cx="116" cy="125" r="5" fill="var(--c1)" style="--dx:70px;--dy:0px;animation-delay:0s;animation-duration:1.0s!important;"/><circle class="pk" cx="310" cy="125" r="5" fill="var(--ok)" style="--dx:74px;--dy:0px;animation-delay:0.5s;animation-duration:1.0s!important;"/></g><g class="rl-w1"><circle class="pk" cx="116" cy="125" r="5" fill="var(--bad)" style="--dx:70px;--dy:0px;animation-delay:0s;animation-duration:1.0s!important;"/><text class="sm" x="160" y="110" style="fill:var(--bad)" text-anchor="middle">rejected</text></g><rect class="cap" x="16" y="214" width="448" height="38" rx="10"/><g class="rl-w0"><text x="240.0" y="238" text-anchor="middle">Requests pass while tokens last.</text></g><g class="rl-w1"><text x="240.0" y="238" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:var(--bad)">Bucket empty: the next requests are rejected.</text></g><g class="rl-w2 an-fin"><text x="240.0" y="238" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:var(--ok)">Refilled: requests pass again.</text></g></svg>
  <figcaption><b>Rate limits in one command</b>LIMIT does the fixed-window, sliding-window or token-bucket check atomically on the shard.</figcaption>
</figure>
